<title>JAPAN: Canon Sales says to isse 5 mln new shares.</title>
<headline>Canon Sales says to isse 5 mln new shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canon Sales Co Inc said on Monday it plans to issue five million new shares through a public offering, with the issue price to be decided later this month.</p>
<p>The payment date will be December 16, it said.</p>
<p>Canon Sales said in a statement that an estimated 13.35 billion yen will be raised through the new share issue and the money will be used to finance redemption of Swiss franc-denominated warrant bonds due to mature in November 1997.</p>
</text>
